#EXTINF:-1 group-title="ARTE Concert - Baroque" tvg-id="1705312662" tvg-name="Whilst male composers such as Monteverdi and Vivaldi were celebrated‚ women composers struggled for recognition or even the right to play an instrument at all. However‚ their music was revolutionary: they wrote operas‚ sonatas and cantatas full of passion and innovation. Maddalena Casulana‚ Casulana‚ Barbara Strozzi‚ Isabella Leonarda.<br/>From 13.07.2026 15:53" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",The Barockers (1/3) - From the Renaissance to the Baroque (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (13.07.2026)
