#EXTINF:-1 group-title="ARTE Concert - Baroque" tvg-id="1252751460" tvg-name="In 17th century Venice buzzing with artistic activity‚ it was difficult for a woman to make a name for herself as a composer. Access to musical education often came through seclusion from the world: in convents or institutions such as the famous Ospedale della Pietà‚ where Antonio Vivaldi was violin teacher.  Behind these walls‚ female talent emerged whose legacy still resonates with us today…<br/>From 13.07.2026 16:17" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",The Barockers (2/3) - In the Shadow of God (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (13.07.2026)
