#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Cinema - Cinema news" tvg-id="33055836" tvg-name="Mia Hansen-Løve describes her love for the cathartic and emancipatory dimension of cinema. From her early films‚ the intimate and the personal unfold with sincerity and a minimalistic aesthetic. 'Bergman Island' is in competition this year at Cannes.<br/>From 27.12.2023 14:08" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",In Conversation with Mia Hansen-Løve (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (27.12.2023)
