#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Cinema - Films" tvg-id="1289159613" tvg-name="Based on Manuel de Falla’s ballet *Liebeszauber*‚ this film tells the story of Candela who is haunted by nightmarish apparitions of her former lover‚ Diego. Diego was killed in a brawl and continues to haunt Candela as a ghost‚ keeping her trapped in his shadow. Her new lover‚ Antonio‚ struggles to free her from this spell.<br/>From 01.08.2026 15:56" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",El Amor Brujo - Bewitched Love (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (01.08.2026)
