#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Cinema - Films" tvg-id="635882092" tvg-name="Trapped in loveless relationship and unfulfilling rural life‚ Christin lives on a farm in East Germany. Under a blazing sun‚ she feels a sense of suffocation arise and her longing to escape grows stronger. But when the 24-year-old meets Klaus‚ the wind engineer‚ things start to change. A film that debunks the myth of country life.<br/>From 29.07.2026 01:18" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",No One's with the Calves (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (29.07.2026)
