#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Cinema - Films" tvg-id="352445945" tvg-name="A film that takes place in a small fishing village in Sicily made up of ramshackle stone huts‚ surrounded by rubbish and scrap metal. Behind it lies a majestic mountain. It is here that Arturo is born and raised‚ a child of poverty and violence; it is here that his mother dies giving birth to him....<br/>From 30.07.2026 08:37" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Misericordia (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (30.07.2026)
