#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Cinema - Films" tvg-id="312269245" tvg-name="In post-civil war Hungary in 1919‚ a former revolutionary hunted by the authorities finds refuge on a remote farm‚ where fear‚ mistrust and violence reign. Amidst oppressive silence and outbursts of brutality‚ everyone tries to survive in a climate of political repression.<br/>From 30.07.2026 08:48" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Silence and Cry (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (30.07.2026)
