#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Cinema - Films" tvg-id="1766260775" tvg-name="In a small town in Northern Ireland‚ a teenage schoolgirl becomes pregnant unexpectedly and faces a deep inner conflict due to the rigid moral standards of those around her. Hush a bye Baby tackles the controversial issue of pregnancy outside marriage and abortion in Northern Ireland during the turbulent 1980s through the love story of two teenagers.<br/>From 12.06.2026 17:45" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Hush-a-Bye Baby (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (12.06.2026)
