#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Culture - Arts" tvg-id="1283175044" tvg-name="In the late 18th century‚ the artist Gautier-Dagoty painted a portrait of the Countess of Barry‚ favourite of King Louis XV‚ with a dark-skinned boy at her side. Why does he appear in a portrait of the most powerful woman in France? <br/>From 14.10.2024 14:30" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Anatomy of a Painting - The Versailles Black Boy (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (14.10.2024)
