#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Culture - Arts" tvg-id="134578602" tvg-name="Like a detective story using the famous “Rokeby Venus” as a starting point‚ this documentary sets out to discover the singularity of Diego Velázquez (1599-1660)‚ the 'painter of painters'‚ and the artistic and aesthetic revolution he provoked.<br/>From 29.03.2015 17:35" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Diego Velázquez - Raw Realism (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (29.03.2015)
