#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Culture - Arts" tvg-id="1608790245" tvg-name="The Matisse Chapel in Vence close to Nice in the South of France is the fruit of a special friendship between a young nurse and nun‚ Monique Bourgeois and the ageing artist Henri Matisse.  Considered by some to be a great religious building of the 20th century‚ it shocked both the Catholic Church and the avant-garde when it opened its doors in 1951. This documentary focuses on a special building and a special relationship.<br/>From 05.04.2026 16:42" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",The Matisse Chapel (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (05.04.2026)
