#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Culture - Ideas" tvg-id="1973618692" tvg-name="In Iran‚ parties are considered immoral‚ as are 'western' music and female artistic performances. Yet in secret‚ behind closed doors in Tehran or outside the borders of the Islamic Republic‚ it is still possible to party properly. Tracks meets those artists who are keeping the Iranian party spirit alive‚ whatever it takes.<br/>From 06.08.2024 12:26" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Tracks - How to Party in Iran (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (06.08.2024)
