#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Culture - Ideas" tvg-id="1806190316" tvg-name="'We are currently learning that we are not the rulers of this universe. We are not the masters of creation. We cannot subjugate the Earth‚' says Vienna-based philosopher Philipp Blom. And he immediately asks‚ 'Then who are we?' In conversation with Yves Kugelmann‚ Philipp Blom engages in a deep‚ thought-provoking exploration.<br/>From 22.08.2023 05:00" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Deep Thought - In Conversation with Philipp Blom (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (22.08.2023)
