#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Culture - Ideas" tvg-id="1047198861" tvg-name="Who would have thought that one day an ordinary open space could give us the creeps? For the generation that has grown up with the Internet: the web has redefined the codes and forms of horror‚ giving us a clearer picture of the anxieties of our time. From backrooms and analogue horror to digital urbex‚ these creepy anomalies are transforming our relationship with reality and renewing our attracti.....<br/>From 06.08.2024 17:42" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",TRACKS - Digital Horror - What Scares Gen Z? (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (06.08.2024)
