#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Culture - Ideas" tvg-id="1485792558" tvg-name="A philosopher of complexity‚ a sociologist of cultural practices and one of the first to address ecological issues‚ Edgar Morin has been a major intellectual figure in France from the post-war period up to the present day. Through extensive archive footage‚ this documentary tells the story of a fruitful life dedicated to humanist thought. Morin passed away on 29 May 2026.<br/>From 08.07.2021 23:58" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Edgar Morin - Journal of a Life (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (08.07.2021)
