#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Culture - Pop culture" tvg-id="497057044" tvg-name="On 23 June 2021‚ Britney Spears appeared in court in Los Angeles to ask for her guardianship to be lifted. It was through her voice‚ rather than her image‚ that she regained her humanity and freedom. On her Instagram account‚ she regains control of her image and shows off every aspect of herself. But what does she have to say about our own relationship with social networks?<br/>From 16.01.2025 16:51" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Britney No Filter - I Post Therefore I Am (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (16.01.2025)
