#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Sciences - In brief" tvg-id="1330322269" tvg-name="Forgetfulness has long been considered a weakness of the human mind. But forgetting could well be a function of the human brain‚ not a flaw. It is thanks to forgetting that we can cope with the inundation of information and emotionally distressing experiences. But how much forgetting is beneficial?<br/>From 09.08.2026 07:57" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",42: The Answer to Almost Everything - The Advantage of Forgetfulness (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (09.08.2026)
