#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Sciences - In brief" tvg-id="1442003833" tvg-name="From a very early age‚ we are instilled with the idea that lying is wrong. Yet learning to lie is a normal and necessary stage in our psychological development. What if lying made the world a better place?<br/>From 17.09.2023 08:35" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",42: The Answer to Almost Everything - Is Lying Good For Us? (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (17.09.2023)
